  "scope": "The canonical host table now generates all texture-stage and sampler defaults for D3D8/9 and initializes host maps for eight stages, sixteen pixel and four vertex samplers. D3D8 W addressing and COLORARG0/ALPHAARG0 now match SDK defaults and send the first explicit DIFFUSE=0 change. Actual XP checks 2480 texture/sampler plus 688 render queries through fresh/ALL/two Reset states; raw bytes confirm three zero changes per operand/API and W addressing. Independent RGBA triadic default/explicit pixels pass on SwiftShader/Metal; two GPU mutants fail default CURRENT and preserve explicit DIFFUSE. Published DLL bytes are the exact default-probe builds; TNL uses independent same-source builds. CONSTANT zero is inferred from Wine initialization, not original Microsoft measurement. Material/other object/mode defaults remain next; no full Wine or game/FPS claim",
